      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated Brazil CEP Geocoordinates, IBGE Code & Logistics Auditor Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nBatch geocodes and validates Brazilian 8-digit postal codes (CEPs) via BrasilAPI v2 & ViaCEP fallback. Extracts Latitude/Longitude, 7-digit IBGE city code (for NF-e/CT-e), state UF, neighborhood, and Last-Mile Delivery Scores (0-100).\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/brazil-cep-geocoordinates-logistics-auditor](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/brazil-cep-geocoordinates-logistics-auditor)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: brazil-cep-geocoordinates-logistics-auditor** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "7a7f1c8e-93a3-59dc-8be9-3b52df087c56",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
